That project is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0,
Copyright (c) IBM Corp. 2014-2026. Note that the Business Source License
relicense of 2023 applied to Terraform core, not to the providers; the AWS
provider remains MPL-2.0.

Where the documentation was ambiguous or contradicted the provider's actual
behaviour, the provider's own Go source was read instead — chiefly
internal/service/ec2/vpc_security_group_rule.go and
internal/service/ec2/vpc_security_group.go, in about a dozen places.

No provider source code is copied into this package. What was taken is
