Attribution: hashicorp/terraform

The two state-file formats this package parses, and the validation rules
governing the `import` block it emits, were checked against Terraform itself:

    https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform

specifically internal/states/statefile/version4.go (raw v4, including how a
deposed object is nested inside the resource's own instances),
internal/command/jsonstate/state.go (`terraform show -json`, where a deposed
object is instead a separate entry at the same address), and
internal/configs/import.go (a `provider` argument is rejected outright when
the `to` address is inside a module — which is why this package emits a
comment rather than a provider argument).

Terraform core carries the Business Source License 1.1 from v1.6 onward;
releases up to and including v1.5.x are MPL-2.0. Nothing turns on which,
because no Terraform source is copied here either. A file format and a
parser's acceptance rules are facts about artefacts this package must read
and write correctly, and they were recorded as file-and-line citations so a
future reader can re-check them instead of trusting this notice.
